OL,3,ACanadian province sues OpenAI over
OL,4,ATumbler Ridge school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Canadian province is suing OpenAI
OL,7,Fover its alleged failure to notify
OL,8,Fauthorities about concerning user
OL,9,Finteractions on ChatGPT prior to the
OL,10,FTumbler Ridge mass shooting.
OL,12,FThe company has previously apologised
OL,13,Ffor not flagging Jessie Van
OL,14,FRootselaar's account to law enforcement
OL,15,Fbefore the 18-year-old killed eight
OL,16,Fpeople, including six children, in
OL,17,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
