OL,3,ACanadian province sues OpenAI over
OL,4,ATumbler Ridge school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Columbia attorney general Niki
OL,7,FSharma said the lawsuit, filed to a US
OL,8,Ffederal court on Monday, raised
OL,9,Fquestions about "the responsibilities
OL,10,Fof technology companies when they
OL,11,Fbecome aware of credible threats of
OL,12,Fserious violence".
OL,14,FFamilies of those killed or injured in
OL,15,Fthe shooting have filed separate
OL,16,Flawsuits against OpenAI.
